{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t第五屆亞洲殘疾人運動會煞科日，港隊在混合佩劍團體賽獲得一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n由鄺遠興、林嘉雯、陳㬢和湯雅婷組成的港隊，在銅牌戰以20:17力壓國家隊。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n劍擊隊於今屆亞殘運共得到3銀5銅。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.906820+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:15:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:28:00.395260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:28:00.395260+00:00","content_hash":"98eb48aa0156d08fa18d687c8aca2b43bc16ffdd7263f676266da8f14241e7cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}